## 8. Where We Want to Get To (Goals)
1. Revive Facebook, Instagram, and Twitter/X, each with its own distinct content strategy (not one-size-fits-all)
2. Build a proper database of members and volunteers — defining what information to collect and how it will be securely stored/protected
3. Establish KPI/metrics tracking — what to measure, how to collect analytics, and reporting cadence
4. Update the triathlon.ky website with more current information (incl. board members, event links to racecaribbean.net for registration)
5. Create a brand guidelines and strategy document (logo usage, color, fonts, tone/voice)
6. Relaunch the newsletter with a proper, defined cadence
7. Add a coaching section to the website
8. Build a content calendar that aligns with the event calendar (swim, bike, run)

